utz">Punctation of Olmütz</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1864</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a> defeat <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/denmark">Denmark</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/second-schleswig-war">Second Schleswig War</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1866</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-prussia">Prussia</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-koniggratz">Königgrätz</a>; the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peace-of-prague-1866">Peace of Prague</a> ends the Confederation</span></li></ol>
